WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.380
Why do we write 3x and not 3 × x?

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.930
It is shorter.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:09.140
In algebra, a number stuck to a letter means multiply.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.450
3x is 3 lots of x.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:15.790
And x² means x × x, not 2x.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:21.013
Try x as 3: x² is 9, but 2x is 6.
